---
description: Say what one edit of a value is for.
args:
  before?: unknown
  after?: unknown
returns: string
---
after is before with one edit made to it (an omitted before means the field was added; an omitted after means it was
removed). Say what the edit is for in one concise sentence: what it changes in what the value means or does, and what
it keeps. Name the purpose of the change rather than the characters that differ.
